   {
    "en": "Parasite Mage: The MMO Chronicles"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the vast realm of a massively multiplayer online game, players fight, level up, and shape their own destinies. But while others chase glory with swords and spells, one man chooses a path no one dares to take— The path of the Parasite Mage. Unloved by the system. Mocked by players. Yet behind the scenes, this strange and overlooked class holds terrifying potential. By infesting bosses, draining enemies, and thriving off others’ strength, he plays a different kind of game—one that only a true tactician can master.\n\nWith strategy, patience, and a dash of madness, the Parasite Mage begins his ascent from ridicule to dominance, turning every enemy into fuel for his rise."
  },
